            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Toy shopping still going strong: Trends to watch this weekend",
            "description": "<p>According to The Toy Insider, 32% of consumers are planning to buy toys this weekend.</p>\n<p>The Toy Insider editorial director, Jackie Breyer, joins Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> on Market Domination Overtime to discuss consumers' toy shopping trends this year and this upcoming weekend.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
